---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/services{{ ext }}"
title: Training & technical assistance
description: "Hands-on AI training and technical assistance for small businesses, nonprofits, and public agencies, co-designed with your team. Approved Commonwealth Corporation provider; eligible Massachusetts organizations can use state workforce funds."
---
<header class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ home.services.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1>{{ home.services.headline }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ home.services.body }}</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ (site.booking_url or '/contact/') | link }}">{{ site.booking_label }} {% include "partials/arrow.njk" %}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#funding">Ask about funding</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">{{ faq.eyebrow }}</p><h2>{{ faq.headline }}</h2><p class="lede">{{ faq.intro }}</p></div>
    <div class="hear">
      {% for f in faq.items %}
      <div class="hear__row">
        <p class="hear__q">“{{ f.q }}”</p>
        <p class="hear__a"><span class="eyebrow">What we do</span>{{ f.a }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--paper2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Three ways in</p><h2>Right-sized. Never generic. Always co-designed.</h2></div>
    <div class="cap-grid cap-grid--3">
      <div class="cap" id="training">
        <h3>AI training</h3>
        <p>Role-specific, hands-on cohorts that leave your staff actually using AI, responsibly. Single-session workshops, multi-session series, train-the-trainer programs, and micro-credentials. Virtual, in person, or hybrid.</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>AI for lead generation, marketing, and content</li>
          <li>AI for grants, fundraising, and procurement</li>
          <li>AI for operations and organizational memory</li>
          <li>AI literacy and workforce readiness</li>
          <li>Compliance and leadership for regulated environments</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cap" id="assistance">
        <h3>Technical assistance</h3>
        <p>An honest readiness assessment, a phased roadmap built with your team around your budget and capacity, and hands-on implementation. We configure, integrate, and stay through adoption.</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>AI readiness assessment and 90-day roadmap</li>
          <li>Tool selection, configuration, and integration</li>
          <li>Workflow automation with a person in the loop</li>
          <li>Board-ready AI policy and governance</li>
          <li>Vendor evaluation and procurement advice</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="cap" id="tools">
        <h3>Our tools, in your organization</h3>
        <p>License Project Lookout for your team, your members, or your grantees, or join Driftwood's early access. Both come with the same care as everything else we do.</p>
        <ul class="plain-list">
          <li>Direct licenses for small businesses and nonprofits</li>
          <li>Institutional distribution for chambers, foundations, and networks</li>
          <li>Build-out partnerships for a whole community</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="{{ '/work/' | link }}">See the tools</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="funding">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Funding available</p><h2>Massachusetts may help pay for it.</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>{{ site.funding_note }}</p>
      <p>To apply, contact Commonwealth Corporation directly at <a href="mailto:{{ site.funding_contact }}">{{ site.funding_contact }}</a> or through their portal, and mention Equity Intelligence LLC as your training provider. We are happy to walk you through it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--shoal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How an engagement runs</p><h2>Three steps to clarity. No sales funnel.</h2><p class="lede">We co-design with communities. We never design for them. Every step below happens with your people in the room.</p></div>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step"><span class="step__n">1</span><h3>Discovery call</h3><p>A 30-minute honest conversation. We listen to your challenges and map your goals, without the pitch.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><span class="step__n">2</span><h3>Roadmap, co-designed</h3><p>A phased, mission-aligned plan built with your team, one that respects your actual budget and capacity.</p></li>
      <li class="step"><span class="step__n">3</span><h3>Support</h3><p>We stay by your side through implementation and remain reachable months after the project is live.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="who">
      <p class="eyebrow">Built for the organizations on the ground doing the work</p>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip">Small businesses</span><span class="chip">Nonprofits</span><span class="chip">Municipalities and public agencies</span><span class="chip">Chambers of commerce</span><span class="chip">Foundations and intermediaries</span><span class="chip">Workforce and apprenticeship programs</span><span class="chip">Schools, colleges, and universities</span><span class="chip">Healthcare and medical education</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% set allQuotes = false %}
{% include "partials/quotes.njk" %}
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
